faq.answer:
If the bonuses provided are not renewed, the service fee for the traffic will be as follows:
On-net calls (1 min.) – 0.06 AZN;
Off-net calls (1 min.) – 0.06 AZN;
International calls (1 min.) – 0.50 AZN;
Billing interval for calls - 60 sec.;
Internet 1MB – 0.05 AZN (interval 512KB);
SMS – 0.05 AZN.

If you have any questions while roaming, you can call Customer Care Center in the following format:
P ostpaid subscribers : +994124905252, +994506565000;
P repaid subscribers : +994124904949, +994502002111;
Corporate subscribers : +994124904940;994506050000;
Calls to the mentioned numbers will be charged from 0.70 AZN per minute after the expiration of the 45-minute free call period.
Call interval – 1 second.

If the internet does not work in roaming, the following operations should be considered:
Prepaid subscribers should check the availability of 0.1 AZN in number balance;
Roaming status should be checked in menu section of the device;
3G network should be activated and the word "INTERNET" (uppercase) added to APN settings.
